@host = http://localhost:5600
@mock = http://localhost:6150

### ===== Happy path =====

### Reset stan
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset

### Wyslij wiadomosc — email powinien pojsc
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Twoje zgloszenie zostalo rozwiazane",
  "content": "Ticket #1234 zostal rozwiazany. Dziekujemy za kontakt.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:00:00Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### Sprawdz stats — totalSent powinno byc 1
GET {{mock}}/admin/stats

### ===== 401 fail fast =====

### Invalidate token
POST {{mock}}/admin/invalidate-token

### Wyslij — dostanie ConfigurationError, brak retry w logach
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Test 401",
  "content": "Ta wiadomosc uderzy w 401.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:01:00Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### ===== 429 quota exceeded =====

### Reset + ustaw quota na 2 (latwiej trafic)
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset

###
POST {{mock}}/admin/set-quota?limit=2

### Wyslij 1 — OK
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Flood 1",
  "content": "Wiadomosc 1.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:02:00Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### Wyslij 2 — OK
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Flood 2",
  "content": "Wiadomosc 2.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:02:01Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### Wyslij 3 — 429 -> logi z retry + Retry-After
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Flood 3",
  "content": "Wiadomosc 3 — ta przekroczy limit.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:02:02Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### ===== Inbox in DB =====

### Wiadomosci w bazie
GET {{host}}/anonymous-users/messages/?email=klient@example.com

### Stats
GET {{mock}}/admin/stats

### ===== Chaos mode (losowe 401/503) =====

### CHAOS ON — 10% random 401, 15% random 503
POST {{mock}}/admin/enable-chaos

### Wyslij kilka wiadomosci i obserwuj logi retry
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Chaos test",
  "content": "Wiadomosc w trybie chaos.",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:05:00Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### Wylacz chaos
POST {{mock}}/admin/disable-chaos

### ===== Admin =====

### Reset (czyści wszystko: quota, token, chaos)
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset

### Invalidate token
POST {{mock}}/admin/invalidate-token

### Set quota (np. limit=2)
POST {{mock}}/admin/set-quota?limit=2

### Enable chaos
POST {{mock}}/admin/enable-chaos

### Disable chaos
POST {{mock}}/admin/disable-chaos

### Stats
GET {{mock}}/admin/stats
